"""Knowledge base for the "Hardcode & TODOs" lens: unfinished-work markers (TODO/FIXME/HACK, security TODOs, remove-before-prod markers, stubs)
and hardcoded values that belong in configuration (environment URLs, IPs, machine paths, personal emails, identity checks, business rates).
English entries plus a Spanish overlay. Read-only analysis."""

